        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#1F3864;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2E0;padding-bottom:3px;margin-bottom:5px;'&gt;Legend&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:9.3px;line-height:13px;color:#333333;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key &#183; &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key &#183; &lt;b&gt;U&lt;/b&gt; unique constraint &#183; &lt;b&gt;&#8722;&lt;/b&gt; private attribute&lt;br&gt;solid association = enforced by the SQLite schema; dashed = logical link only (applicant &#8594; application)&lt;br&gt;navy = identity &amp; access &#183; teal = scoring data &#183; violet = application workflow &#183; orange = officer assignment&lt;br&gt;Multiplicities are shown at both ends; role names describe the association end.&lt;br&gt;A3 landscape (1654 &#215; 1169 px) &#183; &#171;entity&#187; = persistence class, &#171;enumeration&#187; = value type&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A94A6;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1032" width="560" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#1F3864;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2E0;padding-bottom:3px;margin-bottom:5px;'&gt;Notes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:9.3px;line-height:13px;color:#333333;'&gt;&#8226; &lt;b&gt;Components are modules, not classes.&lt;/b&gt; WebApp (webapp.py), ApiBlueprint (api_routes.py), AuthGuard (auth.py) and ScoringService (portal_core.py) expose operations only; persistence is centralised in db.py.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Role, ApplicationStatus, PredictionDecision and OfficerDecision match SQLite CHECK constraints; Tier has no CHECK &#8212; its values come from api_routes.TIERS (likely, review, refer).&lt;br&gt;&#8226; The application_decisions.decision CHECK also permits 'assigned', but the code never inserts it there; 'assigned' is set on loan_applications.status by db.assign_application().&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Applicant &#8594; LoanApplication is a logical 0..1 link via loan_applications.applicant_id; there is no reverse foreign key, so the dashed edge is not schema-enforced.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A94A6;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="620" y="1032" width="992" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
